text":"世界を混沌に陥れるはずだった、狼の耳と尻尾を持つ魔王の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"繰り返し魔王が生み出される世界で、2525代目に生み出された新人魔王。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先代魔王が新によって倒された後、本来なら数十年～数百年後に誕生するはずが、なんの間違いかわずか数日で生み出されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"力も準備も不完全なまま、再び勇者として召喚された新と戦い一蹴される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の不甲斐なさに号泣しているところを優しくされて、勇者である新に一目惚れしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根はまじめで素直、かつ豆腐のように壊れやすいメンタルの持ち主で、まるっきり魔王に向いていない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"28293"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"28293","value":"新に撫でてもらう、友達と一緒"},{"label":"嫌い","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"28293","value":"ひとりぼっち、怪談話"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"28293","value":"速読、暗記"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"28293","value":"読書"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4440","sourceWorkId":"20487","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"150 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4440","sourceWorkId":"20487","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4440","sourceWorkId":"20487","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4440","sourceWorkId":"20487","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/20bd21dfda7966d69ef795b753f7855f276df21c5e07fdf4ed61f56950c3ed51.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/28826ad8b55e19c9173d7d8112c33bd4807dd3b509e71e6b4a4ecba894fe5551.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井浩美","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus